exports[`every refusal's advice is a proposal the check takes > template-no-prompt (0): is met, and each way it says to put it right is accepted 1`] = `""Gen" names template "storyboard-grid-25" and sends no prompt. Send the template's prompt as its own, rewritten in the reader's language with their story or detail in it: [{"text":"Use "}, {"ref": <index of the node wired in for character or scene reference>}, {"text":" as the reference. Create ONE image: a storyboard grid of exactly 5 rows and 5 columns, 25 equal panels in total, separated by thin white gutters, read left to right and top to bottom as one continuous sequence in time. Story: "}, {"slot":{"kind":"tweak","label":"the story","note":"the story"}}, {"text":". Every panel keeps the same people, outfits, location and lighting as the reference. Vary shot size and camera angle from panel to panel like a film storyboard. No text, no numbers."}]. Each node the prompt @s goes into the pool. A node holding material or words goes into "Gen" by an edge with into: "pool" and a ref @'ing it; an empty one by an edge with into: "pool" and a ref @'ing it and a note saying what to do first."`;

